  "problem": "Let ${J}_{n}(\\lambda )$ denote an $n\\times n$ Jordan block with $\\lambda $ on the main diagonal. Fill in the missing entries in the matrix below.\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\">$\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3{J}_{2}(\\frac{\\pi }{6}))=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"30px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td width=\"30px\" align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
